te P on one side. \\n\\nRecorded on October 21, 1956.\\n\\nFirst catalog number on cover, second on labels.\\n\\nRunouts are etched except Plastylite \\\"P\\\" (sometimes incorrectly referred to as \\\"ear\\\") that is stamped on the B-side.\\n\",\"notes_source\":\"RELEASE\"}",
